{"asset_key":"ep6/env_story_16318470","episode":"ep6","category":"env_story","story_id":"16318470","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:2:1631847001:1":{"text":"Take a look. This one's the latest drop, right?","source_cn":"你看看，这是不是最新款的星月同行。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBC524CCB85829DB9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1631847002:1":{"text":"Wait, it is! I thought this one sold out ages ago.","source_cn":"还真是哎，这件不是限量发售，已经卖完了么？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x212C3B8AB78DD1C0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1631847003:1":{"text":"Not for me. I've got my own sources.","source_cn":"呵呵，我当然是有自己的渠道。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x779744F4EF0E552E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1631847004:1":{"text":"Wow. Then do you have that Emerald Heart cloak everyone wanted last month?","source_cn":"好厉害，那上个月最火的翠湖之心披风，您这里也有么？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2ACF98A5F1CFCA55","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1631847005:1":{"text":"Sure do. And guess what, buy both and I'll knock twenty percent off!","source_cn":"有，当然有。不仅如此，这两件现在一起买可以打八折！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB473D068210F0E16","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1631847006:1":{"text":"You even have that? I heard they stopped making it because they ran out of materials.","source_cn":"这都有？但我听说翠湖之心不是因为原材料的原因已经停售了么。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x06F6954B13A3B8B9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1631847007:1":{"text":"That's why you're talking to a pro. Want me to wrap them up for you?","source_cn":"要不怎么说，我神通广大呢。这两件我都给你包起来？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x57DACC8BEA941FC9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:9:1631847007":{"text":"That's why you're talking to a pro. Want me to wrap them up for you?","source_cn":"要不怎么说，我神通广大呢。这两件我都给你包起来？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x57DACC8BEA941FC9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1631847008:1":{"text":"Actually... yeah, the colors look kinda weird up close.","source_cn":"确实，细看之下，这两件衣服好像和我见过的都有一些色差。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x745DE19F6B12B11E","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Actually... yeah, the colors look kinda weird up close.","female":"Actually... yeah, the colors look kinda weird up close.","variant_male_record_index":"222957","variant_female_record_index":"222958","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1631847009:1":{"text":"The stitching's rough too.","source_cn":"不仅如此，这个衣服的走线非常粗糙。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xD7B5F7CCD01E287E","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"The stitching's rough too.","female":"The stitching's rough too.","variant_male_record_index":"222959","variant_female_record_index":"222960","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1631847010:1":{"text":"Uh... I think I'll pass.","source_cn":"我……我还是不考虑了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2A2E4F6F6C40F8C8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1631847011:1":{"text":"Hey, it's not a knockoff. It's a high-end reproduction! You're paying for the design anyway, who cares?","source_cn":"我这可不是盗版，是一种高级的仿制！反正你买的就是设计，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x33F205E25FC48FD7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:14:1631847011":{"text":"Hey, it's not a knockoff. It's a high-end reproduction! You're paying for the design anyway, who cares?","source_cn":"我这可不是盗版，是一种高级的仿制！反正你买的就是设计，有什么关系。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x33F205E25FC48FD7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1631847012:1":{"text":"You again? Ugh. Just my luck!","source_cn":"怎么又是你！真……真是晦气！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x14C4514FFE384665","variant_status":"runt